# Refactor legacy JavaFX to JRebirth

## Migration order
1. Identify UI state and move it to Model.
2. Isolate node construction into View.
3. Move event hookup into Controller.
4. Extract explicit actions into Commands.
5. Extract slow or external work into Services.
6. Introduce Waves only where decoupling is useful.

## Safety rule
Refactor incrementally, not by rewriting everything blindly.
